<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00194/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>項鉬媌述：</strong>壹(1)支嘿銫圓銖筆。鉂砽項鉬書瀉の傼茡，以忣媌述垓項鉬の傼茡嘟鱂桧被轉换爲煋芠。Letters except Chinese characters will not be affected.<br />
<strong>迴収ㄖ期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>迴収地點：</strong>深zんeи鈰████汏㙾<br />
<strong>當椾狀態：</strong>被収容玗Site-CN-██低價ィ直粅ρiη収容匮。</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00194" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00194" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00194-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/coldmist" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6439634); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6439634&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609272125" alt="Coldmist" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6439634)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/coldmist" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6439634); return false;">Coldmist</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1589353886 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">13 May 2020 07:11</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00204/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>由██国产的一部华█手机。当有非该国国籍的人手持该项目，并以夸张的表情和语气说出夸赞有关该国的话时，该项目会变成一部iP█one手机。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>2020/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>一名俄罗斯籍男子手中。<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>被保存于Site-CN-57中的一个低危异常储存柜中。<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong>我一直支持国产！嘿！S█ri，我的█文好吗？——Fula████</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00204" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00204" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00204-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-fishbone" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6127045); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6127045&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609272125" alt="Dr Fishbone" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6127045)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-fishbone" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6127045); return false;">Dr Fishbone</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1589607754 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">16 May 2020 05:42</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00070/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一条牛仔裤，无论何人于何时穿上这条牛仔裤，去何地，排队购买何种商品，排到他时，该商品一定断货，且该商品一天之内得不到进货。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>██服装店<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>特工EVIL的藏品，使用中。<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong><em>不仅穿上它的人遭殃，排在他后面的人也得遭殃。</em>——特工EVIL<br />
<em>特工EVIL他爹是卖炸鸡块的，特工EVIL家对面也是卖炸鸡块的，特工EVIL为了帮他爹打败竞争对手，每天都穿上这条牛仔裤去对面买炸鸡块,这样对手就没得卖了</em>——Dr.shadeoi</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00070" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00070" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00070-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/steven-the-shadow" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6316800); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6316800&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609272125" alt="Steven the shadow" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6316800)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/steven-the-shadow" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6316800); return false;">Steven the shadow</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1587091447 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">17 Apr 2020 02:44</span></p>
</div>
